pan></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423760/extras/026477da992cee3b2152bd6063af7d99.poster.avif?t=1772282209\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423760/extras/026477da992cee3b2152bd6063af7d99.webm?t=1772282209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423760/extras/026477da992cee3b2152bd6063af7d99.mp4?t=1772282209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story\u2019s not your thing? Try <strong>Endless Winter Mode</strong> \u2013 play as long as you like without worrying about the plot. The crew\u2019s still there, just a bit less stressed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got an eye for 1960s Alpine interior design? <strong>Creative Mode</strong> unlocks later in the game and lets you build the lodge of your dreams!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still not enough? You\u2019ll find a special folder in the game directory where you can drop your own <strong>posters, pictures, and carpet designs</strong>. Make the shelter truly yours!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to pack up enough snacks, and see you on the trail!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423760/extras/172980b07680bcf5cd22edafbbf4ca34.poster.avif?t=1772282209\" width=1084 height=737 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423760/extras/172980b07680bcf5cd22edafbbf4ca34.webm?t=1772282209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Above the Desk"],"g